<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus wants simplified Havas share structure.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus wants simplified Havas share structure.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canal Plus chairman Pierre Lescure said on Tuesday that he was in favour of a simplification of the shareholder structure of Havas in which his company is a large shareholder.</p>
<p>&quot;If you look at the diversity of interests around the table at Havas, it would be in the interests of Havas to have a simplification,&quot; he told an industrial conference.</p>
<p>Lescure is a supervisory board member of Havas. Other major shareholders include Generale des Eaux, Alcatel and groups controlled by Belgian businessman Albert Frere.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 mmm/pmc</p>
